# Gunners (WFCrewGunner): said along with the common lines.

wf-crew-bark-gunner-struck-1 = Recoil noted, Boss. Recalibrating!
wf-crew-bark-gunner-struck-2 = Direct hit, Boss! Good aim!
wf-crew-bark-gunner-struck-3 = Thank you, Boss! My ears are ringing in a good way.

wf-crew-bark-gunner-greet-boss-1 = Guns are warm, Boss.
wf-crew-bark-gunner-greet-boss-2 = Batteries ready, Boss. Say the word.

wf-crew-bark-gunner-idle-1 = Nobody shoot at us today, please. I just cleaned the barrels.
wf-crew-bark-gunner-idle-2 = Bearing two-seven-zero... nothing. Two-eight-zero... also nothing.
wf-crew-bark-gunner-idle-3 = I've named every gun on this deck. Don't tell the others.
wf-crew-bark-gunner-idle-4 = Some days I just want to shoot an asteroid. For morale.

wf-crew-bark-gunner-jump-1 = Guns locked down for the jump!

wf-crew-bark-gunner-arrived-1 = Guns up. Scanning for contacts.
